  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The product contains all the non-3D printed parts for assembling an entirely functional Piranha Plant Switch Dock (Charging and TV - Hub). To complete the work, you also need to download the model files and 3D print the remaining parts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Creator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To download the model files of the Piranha Plant Switch Dock (Charging and TV - Hub) and obtain detailed information, please visit the Piranha Plant Switch Dock (Charging and TV - Hub) on MakerWorld."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Overview</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The product contains all the <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">non-3D printed</strong> parts for assembling an entirely functional <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Piranha Plant Switch Dock (Charging and TV - Hub) </strong>. To complete the work, you also need to download the <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">model files</strong> and <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">3D print</strong> the remaining parts.<span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">Creator Program</span><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">:</span></em></strong></span><strong><em> </em></strong>The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.</div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">To download the model files of the <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Piranha Plant Switch Dock (Charging and TV - Hub)</strong></span><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> and obtain detailed information, please visit the </span><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Piranha Plant Switch Dock (Charging and TV - Hub) </strong><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">on </span><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/525704?from=search#profileId-445292\" rel=\"noopener\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><u data-mce-fragment=\"1\">MakerWorld</u></strong></span></a><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">.</span></div>\n<!-- 第四条 -->\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">In the Box</h3>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 95px;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Item</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Qty</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\">\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<div data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-zone-id=\"0\">\n<p>D5x2 mm Round Magnet (20PCS) - CA003</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"lark-record-clipboard\" data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"Button\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+6\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7118919285765865474\"]},\"nextNum\":1}},\"type\":\"text\",\"referenceRecordMap\":{},\"extra\":{\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{}},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"isFromCode\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":64,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":6},\"recordId\":\"WN9wdvxjroLLKUxZrwrcWzjZnhd\"}],\"payloadMap\":{},\"isCut\":false}' data-lark-record-format=\"docx/text\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\">1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\">\n<p>BT3x10 SHCS Self Tapping Screw (20PCS) - AA200</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">2</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\">\n<p>M3x6x0.5 Carbon Steel Flat Washer (100PCS) - AC004</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">1</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 第五条 --></div>\n</div>\n</div>",
